# Camera-roll and screenshot filenames. Every image the site uses is named
# for what it shows, so a file called IMG_1234 or Screenshot... arrived here
# by accident and is more likely to be private than to be an asset.
# Already-tracked files in site_backup are unaffected.
IMG_*.[pP][nN][gG]
IMG_*.[jJ][pP][gG]
IMG_*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
IMG_*.[hH][eE][iI][cC]
[Ss]creenshot*.[pP][nN][gG]
[Ss]creenshot*.[jJ][pP][gG]
[Ss]creen [Ss]hot*.png
